  - nodeId: lp_dublin
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Pi\u0105tek, po zamkni\u0119ciu. Pusta kuchnia nad Liffey, deszcz o szyb\u0119, ten sam od sze\u015Bciu lat."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: lp_plate
  - nodeId: lp_perth
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Pi\u0105tek, po ostatniej zmianie. Nad obozem gwiazdy, kt\xF3rych nie ma na irlandzkim ani polskim niebie. Gavin \u015Bpi."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: lp_plate
  - nodeId: lp_poland
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Pi\u0105tek, po zamkni\u0119ciu. Za oknem hotelowej kuchni \u015Bwiec\u0105 si\u0119 budy jarmarku, a z Mariackiej wie\u017Cy kto\u015B gra hejna\u0142."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: lp_plate
  - nodeId: lp_plate
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Na stali zosta\u0142 jeden talerz. Kuba m\xF3g\u0142by zostawi\u0107 go zmywakowi. Bierze g\u0105bk\u0119."
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Zeskroba\u0107. Sp\u0142uka\u0107. Szorowa\u0107, a\u017C zapiszczy. Pod \u015Bwiat\u0142o."
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Camus pisa\u0142, \u017Ce trzeba wyobra\u017Ca\u0107 sobie Syzyfa szcz\u0119\u015Bliwym. Przez sze\u015B\u0107 lat my\u015Bla\u0142em, \u017Ce to o kamieniu. To nie o kamieniu. To o tym, \u017Ce kto\u015B go codziennie podnosi i nie przestaje by\u0107 sob\u0105."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices:
    - choiceText: "Odk\u0142adam talerz na stojak i gasz\u0119 \u015Bwiat\u0142o."
      targetNodeId: lp_rack
      requiredFlag: 
    - choiceText: "Dzwoni\u0119 do domu. Wszystko jedno, kt\xF3ry dom odbierze."
      targetNodeId: lp_call
      requiredFlag: 
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: 
  - nodeId: lp_rack
    lines:
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Czysty. Jeden talerz z miliona. Wyobra\u017Cam sobie Syzyfa szcz\u0119\u015Bliwym. Tym razem naprawd\u0119."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: -5
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: lp_end
  - nodeId: lp_call
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "D\u0142ugi sygna\u0142. Kto\u015B odbiera."
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Nie powiem, kto. To ju\u017C niewa\u017Cne, w kt\xF3rym kraju. Wa\u017Cne, \u017Ce kto\u015B odebra\u0142."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags:
    - ch6_called_home
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: -10
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: lp_end
  - nodeId: lp_end
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Koniec. Dzi\u0119kujemy, \u017Ce zmywa\u0142e\u015B z Kub\u0105."
